SUMMARY:Saturday Night Mix\, Mingle and Movie Night! (The Devil Wears Prad
 a 2)
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\nHello everyone\,\n\n\\*\\*Kindly r
 ead the details carefully below\\*\\*\n\nPlease join me and my other group
 s for a great evening of **Mix\, Mingling and the brand new Film- The Devi
 l Wears Prada 2.**\n\nMix and Mingle beforehand as we get settled in\, get
  to know each other\, share some laughs\, and get ready to see a great fil
 m. With a bonus group discussion immidiately following the film.\n\nInclud
 ing a pre-movie mix and mingle\, movie related ice-breaker (to get to know
  everyone) in the cool (V.I.P lounge)\n\\*Dinner/Food/Beverages avaialbe i
 n the lounge prior to film\n\n\\*Joined by my other groups too\; so we can
  anticipate a great turn out\n\n**Where to Meet when you arrive?**\n\n***\
 \*Meet me and the others right outside the box office beside the air hocke
 y and arcade games)* (8:30 pm to 8:50 pm)**\n\n{Further Details below:}\n\
 nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)\n\nEvent Details:\n**Satu
 rday Night Mix\, Mingle and Movie Night! (The Devil Wears Prada 2)**\n\n-A
  great night to mix\, mingle\, make new friends and go see a great movie\n
 \n**About Film: The Devil Wears Prada 2**\n\nMiranda Priestly struggles ag
 ainst Emily Charlton\, her former assistant turned rival executive\, as th
 ey compete for advertising revenue amid declining print media\, while Mira
 nda nears retirement.\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
 \\-\\-\\-\n**Event Fee:** for Mix and Mingle before and after film\n\n5 do
 llars by e transfer in advance to steveflemming11@gmail.com\nor by cash in
  person)\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n(Movie fee-
  separate- we will purchase our ticket together when we all arrive)\n\n**W
 here and When to Find Us?**\n\n**Location:** **(Inside Yonge & Eglinton Ce
 ntre)**\n2300 Yonge Street\, Toronto\, ON M4P 1E4\n\n**(We will meet out f
 ront of box office beside the air hockey table and arcade)**\n(Simply walk
  up the steps from the outside and come into the Centre- turn left and we 
 will be waiting right there)\n\n**Arrive between 8:30 pm and 8:50 pm**\n(W
 e will head to the V.I.P. lounge for a beverage\, food (optional) before h
 eading to see the film) (optional)\n\n**Close to the Yonge and Eglinton su
 bway**\n(Lots of parking in the area and 2 minute walk from the subway sta
 tion)
